          },
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You come from a line of wandering mercenaries constantly on the march and scavenging food on the trail. If you fail, but don't critically fail, to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Subsist] in the wilderness, you can still keep yourself fed with poor meals. When exploring, you can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Hustle] twice as long before you have to stop.</p>"
